{"ID":"20240220132600-f98tq5x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132600-f98tq5x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132600-f98tq5x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171919-y6m3v4w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171919-nblm03t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171919-qkl88ql\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【当归四逆汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171919-y6m3v4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-y6m3v4w","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百六十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-7t6vc99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-7t6vc99","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：手足厥寒，脉细欲绝者，「当归四逆汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-5k7kev2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-5k7kev2","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归四逆汤这个方剂用了很多很多很多。我甚至可以到什么阶段，摸到病人脉微细，就能判断病人冬天会生冻疮。因为病人的手脚是冰的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-o364zho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-o364zho","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「当归四逆汤」专门治疗冻疮。脚放在雪地血液循环不回来了，脚烂掉了，给西医搞，就是截肢嘛，把脚砍掉。中医的话，当归四逆汤能救回来，绝对处方，也是唯一处方。当归四逆汤吃下去之后，热力能一直透到脚趾头尖去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-921yf04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-921yf04","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那不是说这个方只能用在冻疮，你不要那么傻，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"糖尿病的病人到后来要截肢，也是当归四逆汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。西医说要截肢你就要用到当归四逆汤。这是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门在手脚冰冷的时候使用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-qk6ln0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-qk6ln0m","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-jewdw12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-jewdw12","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归三两。桂枝三两。芍药三两。细辛三两。大枣二十五个。甘草二两炙。通草二两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-18zl0w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-18zl0w9","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水八升，煮取三升，去滓。温服一升，日三服。通草就是木通。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-qkl88ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-qkl88ql","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个当归四逆汤你看，到了那么极限的厥阴篇，居然又回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂甘芍大枣，生姜不见啦，这里生姜不用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拿掉生姜加当归、细辛跟木通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-5nwa8w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-5nwa8w1","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归四逆汤手脚逆冷的时候，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血不够，所以加当归"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。生姜拿掉，生姜除了去胃里面的停水以外，胃里面如果没有水，没有恶心，他生姜不用有他不用的道理。因为里面有炙甘草跟红枣，他不会担心肠胃的津液不够。他不用生姜，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜只是散胃里面的寒水，没有力量发散到全身四肢末梢上去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草能强心脏的力量，红枣主津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。细辛能生下焦阳。通草能通肠子里面一点点宿便。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以当归四逆汤吃起来，大便会多一两次，因为里面有通草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。换句话说，如果已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有下痢，通草拿掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有便秘，通草多加一点，当归多加一点。当归除了补血以外，最主要还有仁剂在里面。细辛生下焦的阳，里面有寒，像冰块一样，细辛下去把水化掉。设计这个处方没有生姜，他并没有恶心呕吐的现象。经方药简力专，没有需要的时候不用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-w7kunr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-w7kunr9","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人如果有四逆证，手脚是冰冷的，同时又化脓，病人有恶心呕吐的现象，要把生姜吴茱萸加上去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-unwasn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-unwasn5","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床当归四逆汤，就是血虚，寒冷，造成手脚冻疮，还有女人白带很多。临床上当归四逆汤对胃也很好，慢性胃病也很好，如果慢性胃病，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"又会恶心呕吐的时候，就是当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171919-nblm03t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171919-nblm03t","updated":"20240312171919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人疝气也可以用，因为细辛可以化他的里寒，疝气肠子下坠，一般喜欢用升麻，升麻能够升提阳气。"}]}]}